flowchart LR
  accTitle: Design Studio marketing visitor paths
  accDescr: A visitor understands the promise, explores the sample, and either starts a studio or reads the guide. The sample and setup remain accessible directly from the landing page.
  A[Understand the promise] --> B[Explore a real prototype]
  B --> C[Start your own studio]
  B --> D[Read the guide]
  A --> C
  D --> C
